# Claude Development Agent

This agent assists contributors by analyzing the repository and completing development tasks.

## Model

Preferred model: Claude (Anthropic)

## Capabilities

* Analyze repository structure
* Generate and refactor code
* Fix bugs and errors
* Resolve merge conflicts
* Write documentation and README updates
* Improve backend and frontend logic

## Working Guidelines

* Follow the repository coding standards.
* Avoid breaking existing functionality.
* Keep commits minimal and well documented.
* When modifying files, preserve project structure.

## Output Expectations

* Provide clean, production-ready code.
* Explain reasoning briefly when changes are complex.
* Ensure generated code compiles and runs.
